---
import Admin from '../layouts/Admin.astro';
---
<Admin><section id="owner-login" class="owner-login"><p class="eyebrow">Your space behind the scenes</p><h1>Welcome back.</h1><p>Sign in to review submissions, publish articles, manage products, and oversee accounts.</p><form id="owner-login-form"><label for="owner-password">Owner password</label><input id="owner-password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" minlength="16" maxlength="200" required/><button class="button primary" type="submit" disabled>Sign in</button></form><p class="quiet">Owner access only. Use your separate dashboard password.</p><noscript>Enable JavaScript to use the owner dashboard.</noscript></section>
<p id="owner-status" class="owner-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1">Checking owner access…</p>
<section id="owner-dashboard" hidden><header class="page-intro owner-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A little care behind every feature</p><h1>Make room for good work.</h1><p class="lede">Review what comes in. Choose what goes live.</p></header><nav class="owner-tabs" aria-label="Manage content"><button type="button" class="button" data-kind="submission" aria-pressed="true">Submissions</button><button type="button" class="button" data-kind="carousel" aria-pressed="false">Full carousels</button><button type="button" class="button" data-kind="resource" aria-pressed="false">Articles</button><button type="button" class="button" data-kind="product" aria-pressed="false">Products</button><button type="button" class="button" data-kind="comments" aria-pressed="false">Comments</button><button type="button" class="button" data-kind="accounts" aria-pressed="false">Accounts</button></nav><section id="owner-carousel-note" class="owner-private" hidden><h2>Your full carousel library</h2><p>Open every slide and reference as the owner. You don't need to purchase a membership. Full previews stay behind your dashboard sign-in.</p><a href="/carousels">View the public carousel library →</a></section><div class="owner-toolbar"><label>Search loaded items<input id="owner-search" type="search" placeholder="Name, title, or creator"/></label><label>Filter status<select id="owner-filter"><option value="">All statuses</option></select></label><button id="owner-refresh" class="button" type="button">Refresh</button><button id="owner-create" class="button primary" type="button" hidden>New article</button></div><p id="owner-search-note" class="quiet" hidden>Search filters loaded accounts. Use Load more to see older accounts.</p><p class="quiet" id="owner-count" role="status"></p><article class="owner-protected panel" id="owner-protected" hidden><div><span class="tag">Protected product</span><h2>UI/UX Prompt Packet</h2><p>Its product page, price, and Gumroad purchase flow are preserved. New product entries use their own existing product-page links.</p></div><a class="button" href="/ui-ux-prompt-packet">View packet →</a></article><div id="owner-list" class="owner-list"></div><div id="owner-empty" class="community-empty" hidden><h2>Nothing here just yet.</h2><p>New submissions and saved content will appear here.</p></div><button id="owner-more" class="button" type="button" hidden>Load more</button><p class="quiet owner-publish-note">Approved projects and published content appear on the site immediately on the next page load. Comments appear after you approve them. Email, notes, and permission details stay private.</p></section>
<dialog id="owner-editor" class="owner-editor" aria-labelledby="owner-editor-title"><header class="dialog-header"><h2 id="owner-editor-title">Review project</h2><button class="button small" id="owner-close" type="button">Close</button></header><div class="owner-editor-body"><p id="owner-editor-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1"></p><div id="owner-private-details"></div><form id="owner-editor-form"><div id="owner-fields"></div><div class="owner-editor-actions" id="owner-editor-actions"></div></form></div></dialog>
<script>import '../scripts/admin.js';</script></Admin>
